{
  "_meta": {
    "current_year_assumed": 2026,
    "notes": [
      "expected dicts only contain fields worth checking for that question — fields omitted from 'expected' are NOT checked.",
      "'country' (singular) checks actual.origin_country OR actual.destination_country OR actual.partner_country against the given ISO-2 code, since the service's field-assignment logic (see core/service.py post_resolve_parameters) sometimes puts a single partner country into origin_country even when it's semantically the destination.",
      "'partner_countries' checks actual.partner_countries as a SET (order-independent) against the given list.",
      "'group_by_contains_any' passes if actual.group_by contains at least one of the listed codes (handles HS_CHAPTER vs HS_HEADING ambiguity etc).",
      "'hs_present' (true) passes if actual.hs_code OR actual.hs_chapter is non-null. Product-name HS resolution depends on a live DAL metadata call — if DAL is unreachable, these will fail even if everything else is correct. Check that separately before blaming extraction.",
      "'time_range_present' (true) passes if any of actual.year / actual.years / actual.start_period / actual.end_period / actual.period is non-null.",
      "category values: canonical = obvious keyword phrasing, implicit = missing/relative info, edge = unusual axis combos, adversarial = deliberately designed to trip intent confusion (see 'confused_with' notes)."
    ]
  },
